      <title>荣耀MagicOS 11 AI窥屏防护覆盖超多机型 智能识别机主并警告偷看</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260831/%E8%8D%A3%E8%80%80MagicOS-11-AI%E7%AA%A5%E5%B1%8F%E9%98%B2%E6%8A%A4%E8%A6%86%E7%9B%96%E8%B6%85%E5%A4%9A%E6%9C%BA%E5%9E%8B-%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E8%AF%86%E5%88%AB%E6%9C%BA%E4%B8%BB%E5%B9%B6%E8%AD%A6%E5%91%8A%E5%81%B7%E7%9C%8B/</link>
